flowchart TD
    START([TaskSpec + ExecutionBudget]) --> ISSUE[Issue Analysis skill]
    ISSUE --> REPO[Repository Analysis skill]
    REPO --> SPEC{Specialized Variant D?}
    SPEC -- yes --> SEARCH[Code Search skill]
    SPEC -- no --> IMPL[Implementation skill]
    SEARCH --> IMPL

    IMPL -- failed --> FAIL([TaskStatus.FAILED])
    IMPL -- edited files --> TGEN[Test Generation + Test Execution]

    TGEN --> PASS{Tests exit 0?}
    PASS -- yes --> REVGATE{Variant C or D review?}
    PASS -- no --> RETRY{Repair loop budget left?}
    RETRY -- yes --> DIAG[Failure Diagnosis -> Debugging edit]
    DIAG --> TGEN
    RETRY -- no --> FAIL

    REVGATE -- yes --> REVIEW[Patch Review skill]
    REVIEW -- rejected --> FAIL
    REVIEW -- approved --> FINAL[Final Validation + Git Commit Prep]
    REVGATE -- no --> FINAL

    FINAL --> DONE([ExecutionReport + Trace + ToolCalls + Diff])
